# Remotion Docker Template Project Structure

Dockerized Remotion starter with three compositions, vendored Claude Code skills from `remotion-dev/skills`, Tailwind v4, and an alternative AWS Lambda deploy path.

## Core Files
- [package.json](mdc:package.json) — pinned to Remotion 4.0.459 across all `@remotion/*` packages
- [Dockerfile](mdc:Dockerfile) — `node:22-bookworm-slim` + Chrome deps; `npx remotion browser ensure`
- [docker-compose.yml](mdc:docker-compose.yml) — `remotion-dev` (Studio) and `remotion-render` services
- [render.mjs](mdc:render.mjs) — selects composition via `COMPOSITION_ID`, wires Tailwind via `enableTailwind`
- [remotion.config.ts](mdc:remotion.config.ts) — Studio webpack override (Tailwind enabled)
- [src/index.tsx](mdc:src/index.tsx) — registers `HelloWorld`, `TransitionsDemo`, `CaptionsDemo`
- [src/index.css](mdc:src/index.css) — Tailwind v4 entrypoint (`@import 'tailwindcss';`)
- [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json) — TypeScript configuration

## Compositions

| ID | Resolution | Duration | Demonstrates |
|---|---|---|---|
| `HelloWorld` | 1920×1080 | 8s | atomic design, frame interpolation |
| `TransitionsDemo` | 1920×1080 | 9s | `@remotion/transitions` (`fade`, `slide`) |
| `CaptionsDemo` | 1080×1920 | 10s | `@remotion/captions` SRT parsing + TikTok-style pages |

## GitHub Actions Workflows
- [.github/workflows/build-and-publish.yml](mdc:.github/workflows/build-and-publish.yml) — push image to GHCR on main
- [.github/workflows/render-video.yml](mdc:.github/workflows/render-video.yml) — manual dispatch with `composition_id` choice + per-composition inputs
- [.github/workflows/upload-to-releases.yml](mdc:.github/workflows/upload-to-releases.yml) — attach rendered MP4 to a release

## Component Architecture (Atomic Design)
- [src/components/atoms/](mdc:src/components/atoms/) — `AnimatedText`, `AnimatedCircle`, `ScrollingPage`
- [src/components/molecules/](mdc:src/components/molecules/) — `IntroSection`, `ContentSection`, `OutroSection`, `CaptionPage`
- [src/components/organisms/](mdc:src/components/organisms/) — `HelloWorldComposition`, `TransitionsDemo`, `CaptionsDemo`

## Claude Code Skills (auto-loaded)
- `.claude/skills/remotion/` — vendored from [remotion-dev/skills](https://github.com/remotion-dev/skills); 35 reference rules covering transitions, captions, audio, Tailwind, etc.
- `.claude/skills/remotion-docker-template/SKILL.md` — project-specific guidance (compositions, Docker workflow, Tailwind rules)

Refresh the vendored skill from upstream with: `npm run skills:sync` (runs `scripts/sync-remotion-skills.sh`).

