- [examples/player/](mdc:examples/player/) — standalone Vite-runnable `@remotion/player` embed demo
- [docs/LAMBDA_DEPLOY.md](mdc:docs/LAMBDA_DEPLOY.md) — alternative deploy path on AWS Lambda

