## Development Workflow
1. Studio: `npm run dev` or `docker compose up remotion-dev`
2. Local render: `COMPOSITION_ID=TransitionsDemo node render.mjs`
3. Docker render: `COMPOSITION_ID=TransitionsDemo docker compose up remotion-render`
4. Lambda render: `npm run lambda:deploy CaptionsDemo`
5. CI render: Actions tab → "Render Video" → pick `composition_id`
